msgstr "The API requires this information for lines whose VAT amount is zero (default: 351 - Other Non-Exemption). If you do not expect zero VAT, check your store tax settings."

msgid "Bireysel Müşteri Varsayılan TCKN"
msgstr "Default National ID for Individual Customers"

